{"id": "security/001", "title": "永远不要信任用户输入", "content": "所有用户输入都是不可信的。必须进行严格的验证、清理和转义。包括表单数据、URL 参数、HTTP 头、文件上传等所有外部来源数据。\n\n示例：使用白名单验证（允许的字符/格式）而非黑名单过滤。对输出进行编码防止 XSS。", "category": "security", "tags": ["input-validation", "xss", "injection"], "confidence": 0.95, "verifier": "manual", "version": 1, "parent_id": null, "duplicate_of": null, "evolution_log": [], "created_at": "2024-01-15T10:00:00+00:00", "last_verified": "2025-06-01T10:00:00+00:00", "expires_at": null, "hit_count": 410, "last_hit": "2026-06-05T20:00:00+00:00", "content_hash": "12020f8a6a902473807a9798539d0e29402a838c78556b4f125b36c64181850b"}
